<Base title="How to use" description="A practical guide to using Warbox spreadsheet companions.">
  <article class="shell prose"><h1>How to use a companion</h1><p class="draft-note">Draft guide — final instructions will be written from the site owner’s notes.</p><ol><li>Download the Excel companion for your game.</li><li>Open it in a current spreadsheet application such as Microsoft Excel or LibreOffice Calc.</li><li>Use the worksheets as a reference while planning and playing your scenario.</li><li>Check the game page occasionally for updated versions.</li></ol><p>These files are aids for play, not modifications to the WDS games themselves.</p></article>
</Base>
